<title>FRANCE: EU panel to vote shortly on raising malt refund.</title>
<headline>EU panel to vote shortly on raising malt refund.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals grain management committee, meeting in Brussels, is expected to vote shortly on a proposal to raise the refund on malt exports to 35 Ecus per tonne from a current 32.50 Ecus, industry sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The sources said the panel may also vote on proposals to raise the refund on wheat flour exports to 10 Ecus from nine Ecus. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
